{"reviewId": "223985612_886bltd4v", "review": {"abstract": "直到90年代之后，期货与金融因素对油价的影响才逐渐加大，最终产生了由OPEC、石油需求和国际石油资本共同决定的局面，国际油价至此才基本实", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "这样一看就通了，川普直接干了委内瑞拉，然后搞伊朗，石油输出国组织应该搞成军事同盟，不然就成菜单了", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "16708-16776", "createTime": 1775244958, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "223985612_886bltd4v", "userVid": 223985612, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 223985612, "name": "蟹黄包", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-baEFQP_Rg9pZPjNZWVpFu10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "蟹黄包", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "老师🧑‍🏫", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "好读书，不求甚解", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 12, "likes": [{"userVid": 223985612, "name": "蟹黄包", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-baEFQP_Rg9pZPjNZWVpFu10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "蟹黄包", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "老师🧑‍🏫", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "好读书，不求甚解", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-30", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 30}}], "commentsCount": 5, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "上签:空手套白狼，美国白赚更多的石油资源。充足且相对廉价的能源既可以控制通胀，又利于制造业回流，促进股市继续上涨。\n中签:让能源涨价，削弱其它国家商品的成本优势，利好制造业回流，同时涨价也符合川普背后石油资本的利益，毕竟是产油国。至于通胀，对于川普这个右派总统来说，促进经济，稳定就业，比通胀更重要，不然也不会天天逼着美联储降息了。\n下签:被bb拖下水，打登陆战，不管结果如何，赚的肯定不如亏的多，要是不能光速结束，大概率打成烂战，川普就等着被弹劾下台吧。", "reviewId": "223985612_886bltd4v", "commentId": "223985612_886bltd4v_c258858114_88BcJSjMy", "userVid": 258858114, "createTime": 1777007042, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 258858114, "name": "pdk", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJmFexgpFh7Jcdczoq9RANV8cdcOuFBpY3CA5wxgz60iceYlFXAMQNQdkunZYzicAbxzeODfuTvTkNa1H2KCx7VveFTfMfjeibCQ52Aia7n6lasUg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "美国想放水，放水的话石油肯定涨价，渔翁得利，所以川普一定要控制石油再放水", "reviewId": "223985612_886bltd4v", "commentId": "223985612_886bltd4v_c545905154_88zmonX7J", "userVid": 545905154, "createTime": 1776902285, "likesCount": 2, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 545905154, "name": "癸癸的野望", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELA8K4B6Al1qr4MACibwicyrdic5rhicSxBzxgUZ1UOAGop4volWeXccS19iboZH5SD6WaxZJic8O9AoI4k2KhvgHtEPwRq0GLrSyhrQdDLNYO9glSw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "癸癸的野望", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "癸癸在学习。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "美联储主席候补沃什不是刚表态要缩表吗？虽然我也理解不了他如何实现缩表的同时进行降息这种微操", "reviewId": "223985612_886bltd4v", "toCommentId": "223985612_886bltd4v_c545905154_88zmonX7J", "toUserVid": 545905154, "commentId": "223985612_886bltd4v_c258858114_88Bb1Z3tB", "userVid": 258858114, "createTime": 1777005477, "author": {"userVid": 258858114, "name": "pdk", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmop